# Build context is the repo root for both images — keep it small.
.git
.github
backups
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/npm-debug.log
.env
.env.local
README.md
DEPLOY-PUBLICO.md
deploy
landing
# Tests run in CI, not in the image. Keeping them out also means `next build`
# inside Docker does not typecheck them — CI already did, against the same
# tsconfig, and the image has no test runner to run them with.
**/tests

